# oracle: compute hma u p in metal units (EAM Cu, Mishin) on a triclinic box with fix langevin as the thermostat: the sites are unwrapped through the tilted box (Domain::unmap), the pressure uses nktv2p and k_B of metal units, and the set temperature is fix langevin's t_target
# oracle-potentials: Cu_mishin1.eam.alloy
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
lattice         fcc 3.615
region          box prism 0 3 0 3 0 3 0.2 0.1 0.0
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 63.546
pair_style      eam/alloy
pair_coeff      * * Cu_mishin1.eam.alloy Cu
velocity        all create 300.0 45678 dist gaussian
fix             1 all nve
fix             settemp all langevin 300.0 300.0 0.1 48279
compute         hma all hma settemp u p 0.0
timestep        0.002
thermo_style    custom step pe temp press c_hma[1] c_hma[2]
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          20
run             100
